Dancing with the Stars Pro Witney Carson  gives an update on her father-in-law's  health  [Music]  the 24-year old dancer took to Instagram  on Saturday to share with fans her  husband Kherson McCallister's father  Kevin is now in hospice care after  battling cancer for almost two years  Whitney posted this heartwarming pic  along with a note that read in part we  are devastated to share that Kevin's  body is no longer able to tolerate  treatment we are just cherishing every  moment we have with him as unbearable as  this is we are thankful for the time we  have had with him I just wanted to say  thank you to everybody who has been  praying for Kevin and for our family I  know I don't post a lot of personal  stuff especially sad stuff in December  Kirstin announced that she would be  pulling out of the Dancing with the  Stars winter tour to be by her husband  and family side during this hard time  it's been really heartwarming that  everybody has been so gracious and  supportive  [Music]
 

